egories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VJlR5mFR86Tap9S2qEMFoQ","review_id":"LV2aY7bH-EAJEV76rYWyDQ","date":"2018-11-08T18:07:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9346095323562622,"text_excerpt":"I was a little apprehensive about fruit in my poke bowl. But I was wrong. The kiwi, pineapple and orange with my ahi tuna was delicious. Plus I added cucumbers to my bowl and I'm glad I did; the bowl needed the crunch. The counter folks were great. The food was tasty and fresh. And, of course, all the spots at AM are super clean and spiffy. While I love the fishes, I'll probably check out the smoked tofu bowl because I love that too. Definitely a great option while you're in Auction House."},{"business_id":"VJlR5mFR86Tap9S2qEMFoQ","review_id":"H1wgrXwABQo1CRajlAhGQw","date":"2018-07-04T19:01:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.926297128200531,"text_excerpt":"A delicious, elevated way to eat Hawaiian-Japanese fusion food! Ambiance: Located in the Auction House, Aloha Lei has a nice Hawaiian-Japanese fusion theme. From the surfboard counter to the Japanese bar style with see-through window to avocado and sashimi, it just screamed Hawaii and Japanese at me. It had little place setting with bowls and chopsticks on top of straw place mats and cute, colorful leis hanging on the wall. A small ukele was by the cash register and the workers had on Hawaiian shirts, all making the Auction House seem a little more colorful and fun. Food: We had ordered Musubi and the Rainbow Bowl. The musubi had 2 portions, each with rice, grilled (I believe) spam, and f..."},{"business_id":"VJlR5mFR86Tap9S2qEMFoQ","review_id":"3ilDN7lUpSGnjBX-6m62-A","date":"2018-09-24T23:27:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.904938280582428,"text_excerpt":"Stopped here for vegan Poké bowl to go. Super friendly service. Bright and vibrant location in a common area with several other small food shops. Not the best Poke I've ever had, but good. The tofu was smoked and had a unique flavor. I liked the addition of the fresh oranges. Would definitely recommend and plan to return."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VJlR5mFR86Tap9S2qEMFoQ","photo_id":"tz5MdeIIbzHx7qThcOw8wA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tz5MdeIIbzHx7qThcOw8wA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9487919211387634},{"business_id":"VJlR5mFR86Tap9S2qEMFoQ","photo_id":"AJyI_hY-4tZtR3oHCFaSdg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AJyI_hY-4tZtR3oHCFaSdg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9285034537315369},{"business_id":"VJlR5mFR86Tap9S2qEMFoQ","photo_id":"T-F6i9wkorVT2FUktfK52w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/T-F6i9wkorVT2FUktfK52w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9018719792366028},{"business_id":"VJlR5mFR86Tap9S2qEMFoQ","photo_id":"UYs_Mp9swZ_E_WgY82a5Hg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/UYs_Mp9swZ_E_WgY82a5Hg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8881552815437317}]},"notebook_case":null}
